loom roster=hot run=295 green=282 red=11 gated=2 mine_red=0 tree_moved=yes
rota lap 4965, row 0 -- Aether, the row that hears; listening for the claim a page keeps repeating, I heard the gate law scan's header repeat "read the scan rather than trusting this figure" and then name its own floor in prose the next lap could build against. A header that hands its successor a condition rather than a complaint is the sound this tree makes when it is working.
